My soul is very sorrowful, even to death.

52
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:17,800
Remain here and watch.

53
00:04:18,580 --> 00:04:19,860
And going a little farther,

54
00:04:20,220 --> 00:04:22,160
he fell on the ground and prayed that,

55
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:25,020
if it were possible, the hour might pass from him.

56
