Simon, are you asleep?

64
00:04:44,580 --> 00:04:46,380
Could you not watch one hour?

65
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:50,100
Watch and pray that you may not enter into temptation.

66
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:54,300
The spirit indeed is willing, but the flesh is weak.

67
00:04:55,260 --> 00:04:58,440
And again he went away and prayed, saying the same words.

68
00:04:58,860 --> 00:05:00,780
And again he came and found them sleeping,

69
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:02,620
for their eyes were very heavy,

70
