and they did not know what to answer him.

71
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:07,940
And he came the third time and said to them,

72
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:08,920
Are you asleep?

73
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,920
Are you still sleeping and taking your rest?

74
00:05:11,580 --> 00:05:13,140
It is enough, the hour has come.

75
00:05:13,700 --> 00:05:16,380
The Son of Man is betrayed into the hands of sinners.

76
00:05:17,380 --> 00:05:18,920
Rise, let us be going.

77
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:21,260
See, my betrayer is at hand.

78
00:05:21,980 --> 00:05:24,200
And immediately, while he was still speaking,

79
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:25,960
Judas came, one of the twelve,

80
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,820
and with him a crowd with swords and clubs

81
