and the scribes came together.

106
00:06:28,020 --> 00:06:30,200
And Peter had followed him at a distance

107
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:32,520
right into the courtyard of the high priest,

108
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,400
and he was sitting with the guards

109
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:35,960
and warming himself at the fire.

110
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,900
Now the chief priests and the whole council,

111
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:41,220
were seeking testimony against Jesus

112
