to put him to death,

113
00:06:42,420 --> 00:06:44,220
but they found none.

114
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,620
For many bore false witness against him,

115
00:06:47,620 --> 00:06:49,520
but their testimony did not agree.

116
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:52,220
And some stood up and bore false witness against him,

117
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:52,920
