122
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:05,620
Yet even about this their testimony did not agree.

123
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:08,900
And the high priest stood up in the midst and asked Jesus,

124
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:11,420
Have you no answer to make?

125
00:07:11,420 --> 00:07:14,920
What is it that these men testify against you?

126
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:17,920
But he remained silent and made no answer.

127
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,920
Again the high priest asked him,

128
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:24,420
Are you the Christ, the Son of the Blessed?

129
00:07:24,420 --> 00:07:25,920
And Jesus said,

130
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,920
