131
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:31,420
And you will see the Son of Man seated at the right hand of power,

132
00:07:31,420 --> 00:07:33,920
and coming with the clouds of heaven.

133
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:36,920
And the high priest tore his garments and said,

134
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,420
What further witness is this?

135
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:40,420
What witnesses do we need?

136
00:07:40,420 --> 00:07:42,420
You have heard his blasphemy.

137
00:07:42,420 --> 00:07:44,420
What is your decision?

138
00:07:44,420 --> 00:07:47,420
And they all condemned him as deserving death.

139
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:49,920
And some began to spit on him, and to cover his face,

140
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:52,420
