147
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:10,420
You also were with the Nazarene Jesus.

148
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:12,420
But he denied it, saying,

149
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:15,420
I neither know nor understand what you mean.

150
00:08:15,420 --> 00:08:17,420
And he went out into the gateway,

151
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:19,420
