152
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:21,420
And the servant girl saw him,

153
00:08:21,420 --> 00:08:23,920
and began again to say to the bystanders,

154
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,420
This man is one of them.

155
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:28,420
But again he denied it.

156
00:08:28,420 --> 00:08:32,420
And after a little while the bystanders again said to Peter,

157
00:08:32,420 --> 00:08:34,420
Certainly you are one of them,

158
00:08:34,420 --> 00:08:36,420
for you are a Galilean.

159
00:08:36,420 --> 00:08:39,420
But he began to invoke a curse on himself, and to swear,

160
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:43,420
I do not know this man of whom you speak.

161
00:08:43,420 --> 00:08:46,420
And immediately the rooster crowed a second time.

162
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:49,420
And Peter remembered how Jesus had said to him,

163
00:08:49,420 --> 00:08:52,420
Before the rooster crows twice,

164
00:08:52,420 --> 00:08:55,420
